OL,3,GNEWSAMP backs campaign to save activity
OL,4,Acentre
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners fighting to reopen the
OL,7,Fformer Scout Dike outdoor activity
OL,8,Fcentre in South Yorkshire have welcomed
OL,9,Fsupport from Penistone and Stocksbridge
OL,10,FMP Marie Tidball.
OL,12,FThe centre has been closed since last
OL,13,Fyear when activity operator Kingswood,
OL,14,Fwhich leased the site from Barnsley
OL,15,FCouncil, went into administration.
OL,17,FOver six decades, Scout Dike has hosted
OL,18,Fthousands of young people and has been
OL,19,Fused as a base for school, scout and
OL,20,Fguide trips.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
